# TCC — Driving Behavior Classification System

## Project Overview

This project implements a distributed system for collecting vehicle telemetry data, performing local model training, and synchronizing model weights with a centralized server using a federated learning architecture.

The system consists of:

A FastAPI server
A PostgreSQL database
Multiple Raspberry Pi clients
A neuro-fuzzy model trained locally and aggregated globally

